00:00:06.799 --> 00:00:10.559
I think Air Force One is going to do a

00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:14.080
flyover which will be exciting for the

00:00:10.559 --> 00:00:16.080
kids. We have a tremendous number of

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.800
