00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.680
beautiful plane's going to make a quick

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:29.840
little flight right over the center and

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.199
entertain the children. and it'll be a

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.000
lot of fun. So hopefully you'll be

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:35.760
there.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.200
>> Say it.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.480
>> Because I think he's doing well. We're

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.440
going to do a teller rally for him

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.040
instead.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.559
>> He's doing He's doing very well

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.760
actually.

00:00:42.559 --> 00:00:44.399
>> At the golf course.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.239
>> Who is what?

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:48.960
>> Who was at the golf course?

00:00:46.239 --> 00:00:51.440
>> Oh, many people. You mean uh are you

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.120
talking about the one over here? Yeah.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.120
Many people. It's very dangerous because

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.280
the holes are too. It's a very obsolete

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:59.039
course and we're doing very well. We're

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.879
