00:00:59.039 --> 00:01:02.960
country.

00:01:00.879 --> 00:01:05.199
>> We'll have top tournaments here. Yeah.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.040
>> Mr. President, you've been doing a lot

00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:08.960
