00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.680
travel with you. How are you feeling?

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.520
How's your health?

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.920
>> Good. I think very good. I think you see

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:17.360
that we had a great rally. That was a

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.600
great rally. And I think that uh

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:21.360
Darlene's going to do very well. I think

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.119
we're all going to do very well. Think

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.479
think you're going to have some very

00:01:23.119 --> 00:01:26.640
We're going to have a strong Tuesday

00:01:24.479 --> 00:01:28.400
night. That's my opinion. So you not

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.439
going to Kansas has nothing to do with

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.360
you being sick of traveling?

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:33.200
>> Oh, you're sick to ask that question.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.320
You are sick. Who you with?

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.320
>> I'm with Reuters, sir.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.920
>> You are a sick guy. Reuters is terrible,

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.600
by the way. Can you imagine? Look at

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.320
this. Look at this guy. He's way out of

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.320
shape. Look at how badly. He comes to

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:46.000
me. Sir, you're not going to go to

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.600
Kansas. I'm not going to Kansas because

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.439
he's doing very well. I'm going to do a

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:51.840
teller rally tomorrow. I'm doing

00:01:49.439 --> 00:01:54.880
Florida. He said, "What's the reason?"

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:56.880
After doing what? 28. He says, "What's

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.479
the reason for this, sir, that you're

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.560
not going to Kansas? You know what the

00:01:58.479 --> 00:02:03.360
reason is? I don't feel I have to go to

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:05.920
Kansas. I'm going to Florida tomorrow

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.239
and I'll do if something else comes up."

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:10.879
But he said, "You're not going to

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:13.120
Kansas, sir. Are you feeling well?

00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:16.239
You've been following me for two weeks.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.239
I feel perfect. You are disgusting. Put

00:02:16.239 --> 00:02:19.920
yourself in shape. You look like hell."

00:02:18.239 --> 00:02:22.480
Thank you, Mr. President. to breathe

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.480
